<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span><span id="S4.T1.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Success rates (%) on the Adroit simulation.</span> We compare our <span id="S4.T1.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">DP4</span> with more baselines in the Adroit simulation. The baselines include Implicit Behavioral Cloning (IBC), BCRNN, Diffusion Policy (DP), and 3D Diffusion Policy (DP3).</figcaption>
</figure>
