<li id="S2.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S2.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S2.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To comprehensively capture global 3D information, the 3D Global Encoder receives input in the form of the global voxel derived from the full point cloud and the robot’s pose. DP4 processes this voxel to produce a compact global 3D representation through our custom-designed DP4 3D Global Encoder. A simple PyTorch implementation of the DP4 3D Global Encoder is presented:</p>
<div id="S2.I1.i2.p1.2" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_language_Python ltx_lstlisting ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx25" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx25.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_keyword ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">class</span><span id="lstnumberx25.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx25.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">DP4GlobalEncoder</span><span id="lstnumberx25.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">(</span><span id="lstnumberx25.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">nn</span><span id="lstnumberx25.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">.</span><span id="lstnumberx25.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">Module</span><span id="lstnumberx25.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">):</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx26" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx26.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">    </span><span id="lstnumberx26.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_keyword ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">def</span><span id="lstnumberx26.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx26.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">__init__</span><span id="lstnumberx26.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">(</span><span id="lstnumberx26.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">self</span><span id="lstnumberx26.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">,</span><span id="lstnumberx26.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx26.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">in_channels</span><span id="lstnumberx26.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">=10,</span><span id="lstnumberx26.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx26.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">out_channels</span><span id="lstnumberx26.13" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">=64,</span><span id="lstnumberx26.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx26.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">norm_act</span><span id="lstnumberx26.16" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">=</span><span id="lstnumberx26.17" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">InPlaceABN</span><span id="lstnumberx26.18" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">):</span>
</div>
