<div id="S2a.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S2a.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S2a.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">4D Spatiotemporal Awareness.</span> To highlight 4D spatiotemporal awareness within the diffusion policy, our DP4 incorporates dynamics into the Gaussian world model. Expanding on this model, DP4 utilizes a deformable MLP to track changes in Gaussian parameters over time. Below, we present a simple PyTorch implementation of the DP4 deformable MLP.</p>
<div id="S2a.p3.2" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_language_Python ltx_lstlisting ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx79" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx79.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_keyword ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">class</span><span id="lstnumberx79.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx79.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">DeformableNet</span><span id="lstnumberx79.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">(</span><span id="lstnumberx79.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">nn</span><span id="lstnumberx79.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">.</span><span id="lstnumberx79.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">Module</span><span id="lstnumberx79.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">):</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx80" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx80.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">    </span><span id="lstnumberx80.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_keyword ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">def</span><span id="lstnumberx80.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx80.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">__init__</span><span id="lstnumberx80.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">(</span><span id="lstnumberx80.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">self</span><span id="lstnumberx80.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">,</span><span id="lstnumberx80.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx80.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">d_in</span><span id="lstnumberx80.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">,</span><span id="lstnumberx80.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx80.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">d_out</span><span id="lstnumberx80.13" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">=4,</span><span id="lstnumberx80.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx80.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">n_blocks</span><span id="lstnumberx80.16" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">=5,</span><span id="lstnumberx80.17" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx80.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"